window.products.push({"id":778002,"name":"Tidy Books® Bunk Bed Accessories Shelf (Age 6-99) The Original Bunk Bed Buddy™, Bedside Shelf, White Shelves for Kids Room, Loft Bed Shelf, Wood, 13 x","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":109.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41R3nFHgC5L._AC_.jpg","description":"💚 DOES YOUR CHILD NEED SOMEWHERE SAFE FOR BOOKS AND DRINKS IN THE TOP BUNK? When I saw my daughter balancing a drink on the edge of her bunk bed, I knew she needed a wall bedside shelf to store her bedtime bits and bobs. I designed the Bunk Bed Buddy, a bedside floating shelf, with lipped shelves to hold her drink, book and alarm clock securely, meaning no more spills and falls. The award winning original design by a mum for her children. 💚 AWARD WINNING; STRONG & LIGHT WHITE BEDSIDE SHELF, fixes safely to the wall, can't be knocked off. Kids love the Bunk Bed Buddy as it gives them a personal space to store their bed time treasures beside them, making their loft bed feel cozy. Looking for a practical (and cool) gift for your tween? Parents and grandparents tell me that they love to gift this bunk bed organizer shelf; it's useful, cozy and can be personalized in our workshop. After all, it doesn't have to be lonely at the top! 💚 PERFECT STORAGE FOR SMALL SPACES. Ideal for kids bunk beds, cabin beds, loft beds, and as a dorm bedside shelf. The Bunk Bed Buddy is a bedside floating shelf, and offers space saving storage when a bedside table would be too bulky. Practical wall shelf anywhere in the house, bathroom, kitchen or baby nursery. The original Tidy Books Bunk Bed Buddy may be more expensive than the imitations, but its sturdy, classic design means it will be a lasting member of your family. 💚 ECO-FRIENDLY, HANDMADE, WOOD FLOATING SHELF Each handmade item is individual with a natural craft look in style and finish. Made from sustainable plywood. No MDF. Non toxic water lacquer finish (low VOCs.) My background as a violin maker means I am passionate about how products are made. We could have coated them with a solvent based acrylic, but I made an ethical choice. Water lacquer shows the natural imperfections in the wood, and is better for the planet and your kids. 💚 SHOP SMALL & SUSTAINABLY. At Tidy Books we believe that when you shop thoughtfully, your purchase will last you a lifetime, meaning less landfill and shipping. THE ORIGINAL SINCE 2004. Bookshelves for kids room and other nursery storage furniture, designed by founder and mom Geraldine to foster kids independence, and supports childrens reading charity Coram Beanstalk. Tidy Books changed the way kids books are presented in the home to encourage a love of books from an early age. Choose well!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41R3nFHgC5L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Tidy Books","source_asin":"B0767KG9KP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-778002","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0767KG9KP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0767KG9KP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
