window.products.push({"id":778039,"name":"FFUWERG Large Scoop Colander Strainer, Skimmer Slotted Spoon Scoop Thermoplastic Colander Strainer Shovel, Cooking Utensils for Kitchen Cooking Baking","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":12.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61vMKM0AQZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Sturdy but Light-weight】FFUWERG colander uses a high-quality PP frame. Sturdy and flexible. Our scoop has good heft and the handle is sturdy. Stronger than other skimmers. What's more, this strainer is lightweight. The entire surface is perforated, making quick work of anything that needs drainage. You can glide through the sauce or the oil and water effortlessly. Great kitchen gadgets. 【Big but Suitable & Humanized Design】FFUWERG strainer colander is big, but its perfect size can be suitable to use for many things in the kitchen. Our slotted spoon has a special design on the handle which can hold your spoon on the container to prevent slipping. And it can also protect your hands from splashes. At the end of the handle have hanging holes that can hang on a hook for easy storage. Right-sized mesh holes allow this skimmer spoon to enable quick draining and hold on to the food. 【 High-temperature resistance & More Safety】FFUWERG slotted spoon made of high-temperature resistance nylon and environmentally friendly materials, it can be used at -20℃/210℃. The strainer spoon won't transfer heat like metal scoops, more safe. At the same time, this kitchen strainer scoop has high strength, compression resistance, and resistance to deformation make it not easy to deform. You can use the soup ladle colander for a long time. 【Practical tool & Multi-use】FFUWERG skimmer spoons are suitable for both cold and hot food, you can use them instead of your kitchen strainers and colanders to strain pasta, meat, vegetables, fruit, roasted or boiled potatoes, tater tots, noodles, ravioli, gnocchi, Oil froth, eggs, etc. Also, you can use this scoop of colanders when you are washing your fruits and vegetables. Owning this allows you to use it on different occasions to save your cooking time. But do not use it in a Frying Pan. 【Easy to Clean】The mesh strainer of our colander scoop is easy to clean. Just like normal washing dishes. This kitchen tools is so convenient when we don't need the dust from the bottom of the pot. Slotted spoons for cooking works great! And very easy to clean. Nice kitchen accessories.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61vMKM0AQZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"FFUWERG","source_asin":"B09MJZT2LR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-778039","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09MJZT2LR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09MJZT2LR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
