window.products.push({"id":778085,"name":"Topblan Cooling Comforter for Hot Sleepers, Rayon Derived from Bamboo Twin Size, for All-Season, Breathable Soft Blanket Absorbs Body Heats on Night, ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":79.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61dkgy1hBeL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Cool & Breathable Experience】: Made of rayon derived from bamboo, this cooling comforter is organic, soft, and comfortable. It is smooth to the touch and suitable for year-round use, especially as a summer comforter for night sweats and hot flashes. Enjoy your every refreshing sleep with our cooling comforter. 【Safe for Naked Sleep】: Our down alternative viscose from bamboo comforter consists of a cover that is eco-friendly and skin-friendly, with a soft pliable filling made of a single block of down cotton. Moreover, the cooling comforter is OEKO-TEX certified, absolutely safe for naked sleep. 【Sophisticated Design】: With its silky lustrous texture and classic clashing design, the viscose from bamboo cooling comforter features ultimate elegance and refinement. You don't necessarily need a duvet cover. If you use one, it has handy duvet loops to secure the corners and edges. 【Best Gift and Multiple Uses】: The viscose from bamboo comforter has three sizes: Twin Size 68x86in, Queen Size 90x90in, and King Size 106x90in. It can be used as an air conditioner blanket, nap blanket, travel blanket, car blanket, sofa blanket and anywhere you want a comfy blanket to keep cool. This cooling comforter is also perfect as a birthday gift, holiday gift, Mother's Day, Father's Day, and Valentine's Day. 【Easy Wash and Care】: The Topblan cooling comforter is machine washable. Tumble dry low or air dry, don't bleach or dry clean. It is easy to store, we recommend you put the blanket into laundry bag when cleaning it to reduce the damage to the fiber and protect the blanket.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61dkgy1hBeL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Topblan","source_asin":"B0C32ZZ6TW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-778085","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C32ZZ6TW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C32ZZ6TW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
