window.products.push({"id":778150,"name":"Native Fab Set of 12 Farmhouse Stripe Cloth Dinner Napkins Cotton 18x18 Absorbent Soft Restaurant Hotel Quality, Everyday Use Easy Care Washable Weddi","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":20.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81SyJE+ajjL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"In the space of a decade, we grew into a sound, modern industry and expanded our textiles activities that help people bring comfort, styles and designs to their surroundings. Since our inception, we have been able to expand and diversify into the various textile product mix. Our increasingly wide range of products, attention to quality, passion for innovation and ability to understand and anticipate the needs of the market. But through it all have always recognized our commitment to our social responsibilities. We are one of the fastest-growing business conglomerates that truly represent an amalgamation of Manufacturing Resources, Engineering Excellence and Product Expertise. We manufacture a large product mix of Towels, Beach Towels, Bed Linens, Kitchen and Dining Textiles, Floor Coverings, Window Coverings, Decorative Pillows, Bath Rugs and Mats, Holiday Products, Bags and Baskets and various other Home Textiles products under our flagship brand “Native Fab”. We the young and innovative brand upscale our collection, to ensure the highest quality and most unique home decor. If we could make every space a beautiful, relaxing abode, we would. With Native Fab, we’ve made a start. Driven by passion, we combine our love for ecological fabrics with a team of skilled artisans to bring you exquisite home textiles. Inspired by the magical properties and rich history of the fabric, we work with a wide color palette and pay close attention to little details to create timeless pieces that fit every home décor. Combining creativity and technology to produce increasingly innovative solutions which meet and anticipate the needs of the ultimate consumers. Thanks to this approach and these values, we have strengthened ourselves over the years and expanded the presence on international markets. Our system of values is based on high product and market-orientated and is enhanced by the desire to promote a model of sustainable and responsible development.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81SyJE+ajjL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Native Fab","source_asin":"B08MT89NF3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-778150","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08MT89NF3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08MT89NF3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
