window.products.push({"id":778176,"name":"Besswin Cordless Vacuum Cleaner, Lightweight Stick Vacuum with 280W Brushless Motor, Led Display, 25 Kpa Powerful Suction Vacuum Cleaner for Hardwood ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":84.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61eoiwL3rDL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✨【280w Brushless Digital Motor】The cordless vacuum generates 25kpa extreme powerful suction on max mode, picks up pet hair, dirt, debris from multi surfaces. Meanwhile provides a quiet cleaning to your families and pets. ✨【7-cell Detachable Battery】Compared with others 6-cell batteries, Besswin vacuum cleaner adopted protective circuit to conserve battery life to a 45 mins long running time, meanwhile provides with over voltage, over current, overheat and short circuit protection. ✨【5 Stages High-efficiency Filtration】Cordless stick vacuum designed with 5 stages fully sealed cyclone filtration system, captures 99.99% of fine particles as small as 0.1um and offers powerful centrifugal force to efficiently separate dirt. Cordless vacuum cleaners provide the ultimate clean air and superior cleaning experience for every user. NOTE: Clean the filter/sponge regularly to prevent suction and clogging. ✨【LED Display】 Get the information of vacuum performance in real time and know the status your vacuum cleaner, such as battery power display, clogging warning, motor power. This design is more convenient and trouble-free. ✨【Lastest LED】 Motorized Floor Head: New exterior design for all surfaces, beautiful generous also brings powerful cleaning function, Big wheels makes you maneuver the vacuum cleaner on carpets with ease, edge grooves can pick up the dust which beside the wall. ✨【Versatile & Self-standing】Cordless vacuum wand comes with floor head, crevice nozzle, dust removal brush, flexible hose, mini electric head, stretchable tube, floor to stairs, furniture, bed, curtains, car etc. Self-standing storage ways, stand the vacuum anywhere when you're tired. Besides, the attachments storage rack could be clamped on the tube, effectively save space and more convenient for your life. ✨【3 Gears Touch Control Suction】Design with 3 different suction power levels from 10kpa to 25kpa and support fingers touch control, meanwhile you do not need to pull the trigger all the time while using the stick vacuum.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61eoiwL3rDL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Besswin","source_asin":"B0BWH4L6RP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-778176","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BWH4L6RP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BWH4L6RP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
