window.products.push({"id":778286,"name":"Sunbeam Sleek Black Design Cool Mist Tower Humidifier for Medium Sized Room Runs up to 36 Hours","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31im9hXFMRL._AC_.jpg","description":"The Sunbeam Tower Humidifier combines state of the art functionality with appealing design to complement any home. This stylish mist humidifier has a sleek black design that blends with any room, unlike other humidifiers that are bulky and unpleasant to look at. The Sunbeam Tower Humidifier provides a refreshingly cool, invisible mist that can aid with the treatment of allergies, coughing and stuffy air conditions. A digital humidistat offers precise humidity control for optimal comfort and each full tank can run up to 36 hours. The versatility of the cool mist humidifier allows it to be easily moved from room to room. Best of all, the Sunbeam Tower Humidifier is dishwasher safe making it easy to keep clean and maintain.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31im9hXFMRL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Sunbeam","source_asin":"B01CIW8K3Q","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-778286","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01CIW8K3Q","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01CIW8K3Q","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":778287,"name":"Pewter Flask with Hammered Design and Silver Finish - 6 Ounce - Handmade in England - Bonus Pewter Flask Funnel","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71zqo3FLReL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"PEWTER FLASK TO DRINK LIKE A GENTLEMAN Enjoying a nip of a favorite spirit on the go shouldn't have to mean drinking from a bottle in a paper bag! A true gentleman needs a hip flask to savor his favorite spirits in, and the BarMe Pewter Flask is the best choice of flask for men who want something truly exceptional. PEWTER FLASK HAND MADE IN ENGLAND, BEAUTIFULLY CRAFTED Unlike other silver flask products found on Amazon, the BarMe Pewter Flask is of true hand-made quality. The flask is handcrafted in England out of the finest lead-free pewter. The bottom half of the English flask has been hammered to give it a unique texture, while the top half is polished to a mirror-like shine. SIP ON-THE-GO With the BarMe Pewter Flask, enjoying spirits on the go is so easy. The flask is topped off with a screw-down cap that keeps spirits from spilling. At 6 ounces in size, the flask for men holds a generously portioned pour of whiskey, scotch, cognac or any other spirit that he desires. PERFECT GIFT The BarMe Pewter Flask is the perfect gift flask for men due to its artisan craftsmanship and stylish design. Give the flasks as: - Groomsmen gifts - Best man gifts - Wedding gifts - College graduation gifts - Father's Day gifts - Christmas gifts - Anniversary gifts - Valentine's Day gifts - Gifts for scotch & whiskey lovers for any other occasion BUY NOW Delight a gentleman with a sophisticated English flask of unparalleled quality! Order the BarMe Pewter Flask now.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71zqo3FLReL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BarMe","source_asin":"B0181RMHLI","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-778287","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0181RMHLI","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0181RMHLI","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
