window.products.push({"id":778428,"name":"Threadmill Certified 100% American Supima Cotton Sheets, King-Sheets, 1000 Thread Count, 4 Piece Luxury Bed Sheets Set, Hotel Quality Sateen Weave, Iv","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":169.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71X1wDIApoS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"UPGRADE YOUR BED LINENS WITH LUXURY IN EVERY THREAD: Revel the royale combination of luxury and softness every night with our authentic 1000 thread count range. Designed to give you the feel of a 5 star hotel, these bed linens are nothing less than divine. They provide ultimate softness, velvety feel, and impeccable comfort, making them worth every penny. From adding a touch of opulence to elevating your bedroom style, these sheets can do wonders for you. PURE SUPIMA COTTON & PREMIUM SATEEN WEAVE FOR YOUR COMFORT: Crafted for a heavenly experience, our glorious 1000 thread count sheets have the perfect cozy feel for your good night’s sleep. These lavish bedding sets are made using 100% natural Supima Cotton yarns, giving them superior softness and smoothness. They are the epitome of luxury and durability packed in one. The breathable sateen weave gives the sheets a natural sheen and makes them perfect for every season. ELEGANT BEDDING SET WITH SIZABLE DEEP POCKET BOTTOM SHEETS: Get the feeling of sleeping on luscious, thick clouds with our rich, high thread count sheet set. Each luxurious 4 piece King size sheet set which includes 1 flat sheet (110\" W x 104\" L), 1 fitted sheet (78\" W x 80\" L + 17\" deep pocket) and 2 King pillowcases (20\" W x 40\" L). Sleep without any worry of bunched up bedding on our snugly fitting bottom sheet. It has a generously sized deep pocket with an all-around elastic. PREMIUM FINISH, DILIGENT CRAFTSMANSHIP & CONVENIENCE, ALL-IN-ONE: From undeniable finesse to long-lasting durability, our higher thread count collection has everything you deserve. Every single sheet is expertly woven with extra long staple Supima cotton yarns and tested to ensure no pilling, no loose fibers, and fade-resistance. Machine wash these remarkable sheets at room temperature and fold them right after to avoid shrinkage and prevent wrinkles. CERTIFIED & SUSTAINABLE PRACTICES WITH 100% SATISFACTION GUARANTEE: We take pride in making some of the world’s finest linens while respecting the environment. Our products and practices are free from harmful chemicals, earning the OEKO TEX certification. All these premium sheets are manufactured in a wind and solar energy powered factory. They are packed in a reusable cotton tote bag and delivered with a 100% satisfaction guarantee, giving you exceptional customer service.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71X1wDIApoS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Threadmill","source_asin":"B0BBXTXXKP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-778428","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BBXTXXKP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BBXTXXKP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
