window.products.push({"id":778453,"name":"Anmytek Rattan Cabinet, Sideboard Buffet Storage Cabinet with 2 Doors Kitchen Sideboard Furniture with Natural Rattan, White H0013","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":159.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Hk7n8H6KL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Enough Storage Space】This white cabinet has a large countertop, with two-tier shelving inside to put tableware, blankets, shoes or handicrafts, which is convenient for placing decorations or necessities, making your room tidy and orderly. 【Quality Material】The rattan cabinet is made of MDF board, very durable and scratch-resistant. The material is safe and environmentally friendly, and will not harm your health. Long service life, even after many years of use, it is not easy to be damp or deformed like ordinary wood. 【Exquisite Craftsmanship】The buffet cabinet features classic rattan panels in a white frame. The natural textures make for a great addition to the room for a boho chic vibe. The crisp white finish can be coordinated with any color scheme and decoration style. 【Versatile Uses】The sideboard storage cabinet can be used not only as a buffet cabinet in kitchen tableware, but also as a locker for books, shoes and other items, or as a home decoration. It can be placed in the kitchen, living room, bedroom, hallway or bathroom. 【Easy to Assemble & SPEC】All parts and detailed instructions are included. Overall Dimension is 31.5”*13.8”*29.3”(L*W*H). Please check the size carefully before purchase. If you have any questions or suggestions, please feel free to contact us directly for support.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Hk7n8H6KL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Anmytek","source_asin":"B0BZ6V7H59","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-778453","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BZ6V7H59","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BZ6V7H59","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":778454,"name":"German Christmas Decoration Pyramid - 18 Inches - Wood Nativity Scene Set-Under The Christmas Tree - Table Top Holiday Decor - 3 Tiers Carousel- 6 Can","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":79.49,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71oPsmwMC6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"It is suggested that the Christmas pyramid is a predecessor of the Christmas tree. These pyramids are not limited to Christmas: in the Erzgebirge there was a custom of dancing around the \"St. John's Tree\", \"a pyramid decked with garlands and flowers\", at the summer solstice. Not actually pyramid-shaped, the Christmas pyramid is a kind of carousel with several levels, some depicting Christian motifs such as angels or manger scenes, and others with more secular motifs such as mountain-folk, forests, and other scenes from the everyday life of people in the Erzgebirge. The spinning motion of the pyramids is traditionally achieved with the help of candles whose rising heat spins a propeller above. Product Descriptions Dimensions: 18” x Base 9 ½ inches x 8 ½ inches  x 11” (top fan) In the Box: 1 x Christmas Pyramid 6 x Candle Holders 12 x Fan Blades 1 x Fan Blades holder 1 x Ceramic Nub 1 x Wood Nub Holder 1 x Manual & Instructions. **** IF ANY OF THESE PARTS ARE MISSING PLEASE CONTACT US IMMEDIATELY  VIA AMAZON SO WE CAN SEND IT TO YOU EXPEDITED****","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71oPsmwMC6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"USA SUPREME","source_asin":"B07YF7XKTT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-778454","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07YF7XKTT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07YF7XKTT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
