window.products.push({"id":778916,"name":"Blush Brown Balloon Garland Nude Rose Gold Double Stuffed Matte Apricot Boho Balloon Arch kit for Wedding Bachelorette Birthday Anniversary Baby Brida","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":24.49,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61VeASEu4KL._AC_SL1020_.jpg","description":"BLUSH NUDE BALLOON PARTY DECORATIONS Are you ready for your unique balloon party？ The rose gold blush brown party balloon kit, the perfect combination of accessories designed by our party planning team, only need one-two set make your party easy and unique. This balloon garland is suitable for birthday,bridal shower,baby shower, wedding,bachelorette,New Year party,Christmas,graduation,party decorations and special days. Details of the balloons garland kit  ◤30pcs x 12 inch double stuffed blush balloons /nude balloons / ivory balloons ( peach in white balloon) ◤30pcs x 12 inch double stuffed caramel brown balloons /coffee brown balloons / apricot balloons ( black in peach balloon) ◤20pcs x 10 inch send gray balloons / send gray balloons ) ◤15pcs x 12inch pink gold metallic balloons /metallic rose gold balloons  ◤ 1 roll balloon garland strip (16ft) ◤1 roll balloon glue dot (100pcs glue dots) ◤1 roll Curling Ribbon (33 ft) How to make a balloon garland? Step 1: Blow up blush brown balloon garland kit with a balloon pump then tie knots, Pull the knot of the balloon through the big hole in the balloon chain, then pull it into the small hole next to it and snap it. Step 2: Randomly combine balloons of different sizes and colors with balloon chain .Measure and cut the balloon chain to the desired length,leaving extra on each end for hanging the decoration with balloon strip later. Step 3: Use balloon glue dots to glue some remaining balloons to the already made balloon arch to make the balloon shape more layered and catch eyes. Step 4: Make it more gorgeous looking, add some eucalyptus, curling ribbon, flowers, leaves, tulle, or more. Warm Tips The balloons are weighing to count and pack, maybe there are some be damaged, with holes or quantity error (1- 2pcs)is normal. Please bear in mind that photo may vary slightly from actual item in terms of color due to the lighting during photo shooting or the monitor's display. Please inflate all balloons 85% full, or easy pop. There are some talcum powder to avoid the balloons sticking together. NOT DIRT. Before blowing up the confetti balloons, add a few drops of water to make confetti easier to stick to the balloon.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61VeASEu4KL._AC_SL1020_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Captank","source_asin":"B09NVLGWS6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-778916","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09NVLGWS6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09NVLGWS6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
